# The API key this extension searches YouTube with. Create one in the Google
# Cloud console at <https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials> after
# enabling the "YouTube Data API v3" for the project.
#
# A key gets 10,000 quota units a day. Searching costs 100 of them, so each
# search made from the panel does, and so does each song looked up while it
# plays (200 when the extension has to fall back to the artist's videos). Song
# lookups are cached in the browser so replaying one is free. Everything else,
# like the home screen and channel profiles, costs a unit or three.
#
# Note: like every other `VITE_` value, this is bundled into the extension and
# is therefore readable by anyone who can load it. Restrict the key to the
# YouTube Data API, and to the extension's origin, when creating it.
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=""
